# TECH-G21: scmos-like tech with an explicit 'erase pdc pwell pdiff': paint pdc, erase pwell (Q-TECH-20).
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/sl -noprompt
snap internal
load a
box 0 0 4 4
paint pdc
box 0 0 4 4
paint pwell
box 0 0 4 4
erase pwell
save a
